# Runtime packages of the hub image (one per line). The pin of image/apt/no-systemd.pref is applied.
# libudev1 (built from the systemd sources) is pulled in by libinput10; the image build replaces its files with eudev's
# libudev.so.1 (tools/image/build-hub-parts.sh). driftwm and eudev are built from source, not installed from packages.
